# C: Mozilla.org: its legal shell, the executive-team company it owns, the trademarks and three events.
nodes:
  - id: C:entity/mozilla-org
    type: entity
    name: Mozilla.org
    summary: 'California non-profit corporation that stewards the Mozilla Project: it sets portfolio and brand strategy, allocates capital, owns the Mozilla operating subsidiaries and the Mozilla trademarks (Mozilla wiki, June 2026), and gives the Foundation an annual operating grant. It stays within the umbrella of the Foundation, which appoints the majority of its board.'
    anchor: true
    form: nonprofit
    roles: [holding, brand]
    jurisdiction: US-CA
    registered-office: 149 New Montgomery Street, 4th Floor, San Francisco, CA 94105
    domains: [mozilla.org]
    global-id: {ein: 33-3437202, domain: mozilla.org}
    tax-status: '501(c)(3): listed as such on the Foundation''s 2024 Form 990 Schedule R; the FAQ says IRS status was granted and Mozilla.org fully operational as of June 2026'
    fiscal-year: calendar
    since: {pending: 'formation date: the FAQ says created in 2025, the 2024 return already lists it'}
    status: active
    visibility: public
    provenance: {mode: net-scan, sources: ['https://stateof.mozilla.org/pdf/Mozilla%20Foundation_Form_990_2024.pdf', 'https://wiki.mozilla.org/Mozilla_org', 'https://blog.mozilla.org/en/mozilla/news/announcing-mozilla-org-new-non-profit/', 'https://www.mofo.com/resources/news/260706-mofo-advises-mozilla'], confidence: 0.8, state: known}

  - id: C:entity/mozilla-management-company
    type: entity
    name: Mozilla Management Company
    summary: Public benefit corporation wholly owned by Mozilla.org; houses the Mozilla-wide executive team and supports organizations across the family. A legal shell inside this atom.
    form: corporation
    roles: [shell, company]
    jurisdiction: {pending: state of incorporation}
    status: active
    visibility: public
    provenance: {mode: net-scan, sources: ['https://wiki.mozilla.org/Mozilla_org'], confidence: 0.8, state: known}

  - id: C:charter/articles-and-bylaws
    type: charter
    name: Articles of Incorporation and Bylaws of Mozilla.org
    summary: Listed under Mozilla.org public records on the Foundation's public records page; the text is not summarised here.
    kind: articles
    entity: C:entity/mozilla-org
    url: https://www.mozillafoundation.org/en/meet-mozilla/annual-reports-and-financials/
    status: active
    visibility: public
    provenance: {mode: net-scan, sources: ['https://www.mozillafoundation.org/en/meet-mozilla/annual-reports-and-financials/'], confidence: 0.8, state: known}

  - id: C:filing/irs-determination-2026
    type: filing
    name: IRS determination letter for Mozilla.org
    summary: Listed on the Foundation's public records page. The FAQ says 501(c)(3) status had been granted by June 2026.
    kind: determination letter
    entity: C:entity/mozilla-org
    status: active
    visibility: public
    provenance: {mode: net-scan, sources: ['https://www.mozillafoundation.org/en/meet-mozilla/annual-reports-and-financials/', 'https://wiki.mozilla.org/Mozilla_org', 'https://www.mofo.com/resources/news/260706-mofo-advises-mozilla'], confidence: 0.8, state: known}

  - id: C:ip/mozilla-trademarks
    type: ip
    name: The Mozilla trademarks
    summary: The Mozilla word mark and brand family, including the marks of the operating companies' products. The June 2026 FAQ says Mozilla.org owns the trademarks; the Mozilla trademark policy page still says they are marks of the Mozilla Foundation.
    kind: trademark
    licensed-to: [atom/mozilla-corporation, atom/mzla]
    pending: 'Which entity owns the marks today: Mozilla.org (the FAQ, 2026-06) or the Foundation (the undated trademark policy page)?'
    status: active
    visibility: public
    provenance: {mode: net-scan, sources: ['https://wiki.mozilla.org/Mozilla_org', 'https://www.mozilla.org/en-US/foundation/trademarks/policy/'], confidence: 0.6, state: known}

  - id: C:contract/operating-grant-to-foundation
    type: contract
    name: Annual operating grant to the Foundation
    summary: Mozilla.org provides the Foundation an annual operating grant and allocates capital to other Mozilla activities.
    between: [atom/mozilla-org, atom/mozilla-foundation]
    terms: {pending: amount of the grant; none published}
    counterparty: none
    status: active
    visibility: public
    provenance: {mode: net-scan, sources: ['https://wiki.mozilla.org/Mozilla_org'], confidence: 0.8, state: known}

  - id: C:event/mozilla-org-created
    type: event
    name: Mozilla.org created, first portfolio strategy launched
    summary: In 2025 Mozilla announced a new leadership model at board and executive levels; Mozilla.org was created, with a small team incubated in the Foundation, and the first Mozilla-wide portfolio strategy (2026 to 2028) was launched.
    kind: formation
    period: '2025'
    status: active
    visibility: public
    provenance: {mode: net-scan, sources: ['https://wiki.mozilla.org/Mozilla_org'], confidence: 0.8, state: known}

  - id: C:event/mozilla-org-501c3
    type: event
    name: Mozilla.org recognised as a 501(c)(3), fully operational
    summary: In June 2026 Mozilla.org was granted 501(c)(3) status and became fully operational; the team incubated at the Foundation moved to it, and the announcement is dated 2026-06-23.
    kind: recognition
    at: 2026-06-23
    status: active
    visibility: public
    provenance: {mode: net-scan, sources: ['https://wiki.mozilla.org/Mozilla_org', 'https://blog.mozilla.org/en/mozilla/news/announcing-mozilla-org-new-non-profit/', 'https://www.mofo.com/resources/news/260706-mofo-advises-mozilla'], confidence: 0.9, state: known}

  - id: C:event/ownership-transfer-2026
    type: event
    name: Mozilla.org takes ownership of the companies and the trademarks
    summary: In 2026 Mozilla.org took on the stewardship of the Mozilla Project and ownership of the companies and trademarks held by the Foundation.
    kind: transfer
    period: '2026'
    status: active
    visibility: public
    provenance: {mode: net-scan, sources: ['https://wiki.mozilla.org/Mozilla_org'], confidence: 0.7, state: known}
